{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, approach and take it. Check properties and perform specific task. Scan for object. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
